  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Back to School in Palestine, Lebanon and Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The new school year is approaching fast. Help Anera celebrate and promote our Back-To-School campaign, starting August 15!  The campaign will emphasize that education is a multifaceted approach, which requires a multitude of factors to keep kids in school and ensure they receive quality education.   Anera provides resources in Palestine and Lebanon to make this possible, such as providing children&apos;s parents with jobs, providing children with proper nutrition at school, and so much more.</narrative>
  </description>
